          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.21.1+1CH.21.2+1CH.21.3+1CH.21.4+1CH.21.5+1CH.21.6+1CH.21.7+1CH.21.8+1CH.21.9+1CH.21.10+1CH.21.11+1CH.21.12+1CH.21.13+1CH.21.14+1CH.21.15+1CH.21.16+1CH.21.17+1CH.21.18+1CH.21.19+1CH.21.20+1CH.21.21+1CH.21.22+1CH.21.23+1CH.21.24+1CH.21.25+1CH.21.26+1CH.21.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chron 21.1-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Again the anger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was kindled against Israel, and he incited David against them, saying, “Go, number Israel and Judah.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the king said to Joab and the commanders of the army,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 Chron 21.2 Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "to Joab the commander of the army",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " who were with him, “Go through all the tribes of Israel, from Dan to Beer-sheba, and number the people, that I may know the number of the people.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Joab said to the king, “May the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God add to the people a hundred times as many as they are, while the eyes of my lord the king still see it; but why does my lord the king delight in this thing?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the king's word prevailed against Joab and the commanders of the army. So Joab and the commanders of the army went out from the presence of the king to number the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They crossed the Jordan, and began from Aroer,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "encamped in Aroer",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and from the city that is in the middle of the valley, toward Gad and on to Jazer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they came to Gilead, and to Kadesh in the land of the Hittites;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "to the land of Tahtim-hodshi",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and they came to Dan, and from Dan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn Compare Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they came to Dan-jaan and",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " they went around to Sidon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and came to the fortress of Tyre and to all the cities of the Hivites and Canaanites; and they went out to the Negeb of Judah at Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So when they had gone through all the land, they came to Jerusalem at the end of nine months and twenty days. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joab gave the sum of the numbering of the people to the king: in Israel there were eight hundred thousand valiant men who drew the sword, and the men of Judah were five hundred thousand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But David's heart smote him after he had numbered the people. And David said to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", “I have sinned greatly in what I have done. But now, O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", I pray thee, take away the iniquity of thy servant; for I have done very foolishly.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when David arose in the morning, the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to the prophet Gad, David's seer, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Go and say to David, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Three things I offer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hold over",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " you; choose one of them, that I may do it to you.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Gad came to David and told him, and said to him, “Shall three",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 Chron 21.12 Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "seven",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " years of famine come to you in your land? Or will you flee three months before your foes while they pursue you? Or shall there be three days' pestilence in your land? Now consider, and decide what answer I shall return to him who sent me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David said to Gad, “I am in great distress; let us fall into the hand of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", for his mercy is great; but let me not fall into the hand of man.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sent a pestilence upon Israel from the morning until the appointed time; and there died of the people from Dan to Beer-sheba seventy thousand men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the angel stretched forth his hand toward Jerusalem to destroy it, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " repented of the evil, and said to the angel who was working destruction among the people, “It is enough; now stay your hand.” And the angel of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was by the threshing floor of Araunah the Jebusite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David spoke to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " when he saw the angel who was smiting the people, and said, “Lo, I have sinned, and I have done wickedly; but these sheep, what have they done? Let thy hand, I pray thee, be against me and against my father's house.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Gad came that day to David, and said to him, “Go up, rear an altar to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " on the threshing floor of Araunah the Jebusite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David went up at Gad's word, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Araunah looked down, he saw the king and his servants coming on toward him; and Araunah went forth, and did obeisance to the king with his face to the ground. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
